+  | 20261118_001 applied (the four 3b families deleted) | with the switch on, edge-bff at or above the 3b follow-up build (an older one expands those families to nothing and refuses every indicator); with it off (`*`) nothing changes | no rollback of the migration (forward-only); an older edge-bff only with the switch off |
+  | 3c step 3: edge-bff sends the owner headers; the fix-round edge-bff requires the acknowledgement | terminal-api at or above 3c while the switch is on anywhere (without the acknowledgement a capped principal's answers are refused 503: fails closed) | terminal-api is deployed before or with edge-bff, and rolled back after it |
